4. YOUR DATA

   The software records how you play in order to train its opponent. That record
   is held in your browser's memory for as long as the tab is open and is
   destroyed when the tab is closed. It is never transmitted, never written to
   disk and never seen by the copyright holder or by anyone else. The software
   makes no network requests, sets no cookies, uses no analytics and has no
   server component. No personal data is collected, processed or stored.


